<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Grande Dixence Ibex Trail — Grande Dixence crest–Ecoulaies–Col des Roux–Prafleuri</name><desc>Start at the western end of the Grande Dixence dam crest, follow the lakeside trail past the Ecoulaies sector, cross Col des Roux and return via Prafleuri. The short access stem from the crest is walked in both directions.

